  "source": "Templates: Cine.Recipes in P12.1 Part C, widened with allowed alternates in P12.7a. Script entries (N167, r40): the event map rows in plan-cinematic section 3, one entry per career script and ceremony kind, cut to shot types in shots.json and to the subjects the stage can build",
  "why": "Beats per script (looked up first) or per template (fallback for a script this table does not name): allowed shot types, the subject role and seconds. Where the map names a beat the stage has no subject for (a sold sign, a magazine cover, a bell rope) the beat is left out or held on the nearest subject; whip pans and slow motion are left to a later pass. Shared sequences only inside one map row (the hearings; top_ten and the rich list; first_tenant and lease_signed)."
 },
